      "message": "I think aapt2 can accept this as a list instead of a single merged file https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/tools/aapt2/cmd/Link.h;l\u003d333?q\u003d%22--add-javadoc-annotation%22\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain\n\nCan we skip the cat altogether?",
